@aberrV_mem_sphere : ∀ {b1 b2 b3 : ℝ}, s b1 b2 b3 < 1 → ∀ (n : ↑S2), aberrV b1 b2 b3 ↑n ∈ S2
'P06ASphere.aberrV_mem_sphere' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
