'P06ASphere.witness_admissible' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
pushforward_without_density_ne : Measure.map (aberrS witness_admissible) σS ≠ σS ∧ σS ≠ 0
'P06ASphere.pushforward_without_density_ne' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
